                                                "sense_id": "0acf5b4c-640c-3198-9aba-9511d95ad1ea",
                                                "text": "Mr. Lovick made a similar experiment, to determine accurately the amount of sewerage from 1,200 average sized houses in London, where there was an intermittent supply of water from the different water companies."
                                            },
